---
import TerminalMock from "./TerminalMock.astro";
---

<section class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-12 px-6 pb-20 pt-24 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:pt-32">
  <div class="max-w-xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">hybrid retrieval, measured</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl">
      Every match is scored.<br />Nothing ships on a hunch.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Sparse, dense, and fused retrieval run side by side on every query.
      Reranking and synthesis only fire when the numbers say they should.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 font-mono text-sm">
      <a
        href="#benchmarks"
        class="rounded-md bg-fg px-5 py-2.5 font-medium text-bg transition hover:opacity-90"
      >
        See the benchmarks
      </a>
      <a
        href="#how-it-works"
        class="rounded-md border border-line px-5 py-2.5 text-fg transition hover:border-hybrid/50"
      >
        How it works
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-1 justify-center lg:justify-end">
    <TerminalMock />
  </div>
</section>
